 ],
 "notes": "trust_amr requires the token authenticated not preceded by a letter, so an amr of unauthenticated does not satisfy it. The declared-role branches are bound to the role name; the aws_iam_policy_document branches are not bound to the role (the planned assume_role_policy normally carries that case)."
